# More info: https://docs.docker.com/engine/reference/builder/#dockerignore-file
# Ignore everything by default and re-include only needed files
**

# Un-ignore directories so the builder still traverses into them to
# evaluate the file-level re-include rules below (buildah/podman, unlike
# BuildKit, won't descend into a dir excluded by `**` otherwise).
!**/

# Re-include Go source files (but not *_test.go)
!**/*.go
**/*_test.go

# Re-include Go module files
!go.mod
!go.sum
